	(gr_text "When I was a wee brat, I never could figure out\nhow exactly to win 'Odell Lake' on the Apple IIe.\nBut I was a killing machine in 'The Oregon Trail',\nshooting 2,200 lbs of meat but only able to take \n100 lbs back."
		(at 237 120 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "a41300e9-6542-4342-9cf9-2dc6e524f37f")
		(effects
